-- `marching_zdepth`: Array of shape $(N_{rays})$, initialized to $0$ [S2, unofficial].
-- `sdf_list`, `points_list`, `marching_zdepth_list`: Lists to accumulate results [S2, unofficial].
-- `valid_mask_max_marching_zdepth`: Boolean array for boundary checks [S2, unofficial].
-- `valid_mask_ray_marching`: Boolean array for surface hit checks [S2, unofficial].
-- `valid_mask_first_query`: Boolean array for initial query checks [S2, unofficial].
