-    - Calculate unit size per grid cell: $\mathbf{unit\_size} = \mathbf{inv\_size} / N_{grid}$ [S4, unofficial].
-    - Calculate diagonal length of AABB: $L_{diag} = \|\mathbf{max} - \mathbf{min}\|$ [S4, unofficial].
-    - Calculate step size: $\Delta t_{grid} = \text{mean}(\mathbf{unit\_size}) \times \text{step\_ratio}$ [S4, unofficial].
-    - Calculate number of samples: $N_{samples} = \lceil L_{diag} / \Delta t_{grid} \rceil + 1$ [S4, unofficial].
-    - *Note: In SDF-based variants, $\Delta t$ is derived from the SDF value itself, not the grid [S2, unofficial].*
